---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Divider from '../../components/Divider.astro';
import ContactBlock from '../../components/ContactBlock.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Artículos de marketing | Guillén Bruna Tricas"
  description="Artículos sobre estrategia de marketing, marca y go-to-market para empresas y directivos que quieren comunicar con autoridad."
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <span class="page-tag">Artículos</span>
    <h1>Ideas sobre<br />marketing y negocio</h1>
    <p class="page-desc">Escribo sobre lo que aprendo trabajando. Sin teoría vacía, sin contenido de relleno.</p>
  </div>

  <Divider />

  <h2 class="case-section-h2" style="padding: 0 2rem; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 0;">Artículos publicados</h2>
  <div class="articles">
    <div class="article-item coming-soon">
      <div class="article-content">
        <p class="article-tag">Marketing · PYMEs</p>
        <p class="article-title">Por qué la mayoría de PYMEs no saben qué problema tiene su marketing</p>
        <p class="article-excerpt">El diagnóstico es el paso que casi nadie hace bien. Y sin diagnóstico, todo lo demás es ruido.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="article-right">
        <span class="coming-badge">Próximamente</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="article-item coming-soon">
      <div class="article-content">
        <p class="article-tag">GTM · Estrategia</p>
        <p class="article-title">GTM sin presupuesto: cómo priorizas cuando no puedes hacer todo</p>
        <p class="article-excerpt">Con presupuesto limitado, la estrategia go-to-market no es opcional. Es lo único que te salva.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="article-right">
        <span class="coming-badge">Próximamente</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="article-item coming-soon">
      <div class="article-content">
        <p class="article-tag">SaaS · Producto</p>
        <p class="article-title">Lo que aprendí lanzando un SaaS B2B desde el área de marketing</p>
        <p class="article-excerpt">Cuando marketing y producto se mezclan, las fronteras desaparecen. Algunas lecciones que no estaban en ningún playbook.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="article-right">
        <span class="coming-badge">Próximamente</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ContactBlock title="¿Trabajamos<br>juntos?" />
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  .page-header { padding: 5rem 2rem 3rem; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .page-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue);
    border: 1px solid var(--blue);
    padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    transition: color var(--transition), border-color var(--transition);
  }
  body.dark .page-tag { color: var(--blue-light); border-color: var(--blue-light); }

  .page-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .page-desc {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
    max-width: 520px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    transition: color var(--transition);
  }
  body.dark .page-desc { color: rgba(232,232,232,0.55); }

  /* ARTICLES */
  .articles { padding: 4rem 2rem; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .article-item {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 2rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    gap: 2rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: border-color var(--transition);
  }
  body.dark .article-item { border-bottom-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
  .article-item:first-child { border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
  body.dark .article-item:first-child { border-top-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
  .article-item.coming-soon { cursor: default; opacity: 0.5; }

  .article-content { flex: 1; }
  .article-tag {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    transition: color var(--transition);
  }
  body.dark .article-tag { color: var(--blue-light); }

  .article-title {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    transition: color var(--transition);
  }
  body.dark .article-title { color: #e8e8e8; }
  .article-item:not(.coming-soon):hover .article-title { color: var(--blue); }
  body.dark .article-item:not(.coming-soon):hover .article-title { color: var(--blue-light); }

  .article-excerpt {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    line-height: 1.7;
    transition: color var(--transition);
  }
  body.dark .article-excerpt { color: rgba(232,232,232,0.45); }

  .article-right { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; gap: 0.8rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .article-meta {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: color var(--transition);
  }
  body.dark .article-meta { color: rgba(232,232,232,0.38); }

  .article-arrow { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--blue); opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.2s, color var(--transition); }
  body.dark .article-arrow { color: var(--blue-light); }
  .article-item:not(.coming-soon):hover .article-arrow { opacity: 1; }

  .coming-badge {
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    border-radius: 1px;
    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    transition: color var(--transition), border-color var(--transition);
  }
  body.dark .coming-badge { color: rgba(232,232,232,0.35); border-color: rgba(232,232,232,0.15); }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .article-item { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
    .article-right { align-items: flex-start; }
  }
</style>
